From: "Barak A. Pearlmutter" <barak+git@pearlmutter.net>
Date: Thu, 8 Oct 2026 11:40:41 +0100
Subject: one manual page for disparPDF and disparPDFc

disparPDFc is disparPDF run by another name, so its manual page was
mostly a copy.  disparPDF(1) now covers both: its NAME lists both, its
synopsis (from --help, which gains "or: disparPDFc [OPTION]... FILE1
FILE2") shows how to run each, and its description and examples take
in what disparPDFc(1) said.  disparPDFc.1 just refers to it (".so"), and
the update-manpages target is now update-manpage.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01DFo7ywK1YasqiQ8A3v7kVX
